Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.17,0:00:07.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:19.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:23.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:27.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:34.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.48,0:00:41.34,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.82,0:00:49.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:55.61,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:59.39,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:04.07,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.37,0:01:10.44,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.51,0:01:22.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.62,0:22:18.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们 在生命的旅程中{\fad(400,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.69,0:22:24.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渐渐地 失去所有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.63,0:22:30.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我仍坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.64,0:22:37.18,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:47.22,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今在那深深的丛林中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.52,0:22:53.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也一定埋藏着 被丢弃的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.36,0:22:59.53,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若能把握时光的轮回
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.53,0:23:06.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许 能再次飞翔{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.18,0:23:14.45,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将彷徨着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:20.89,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生存下去 直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.05,0:23:26.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仍然坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:33.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:39.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可急着去救戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:41.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让我们在这里浪费时间啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:55.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱上戈薇的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人不是食物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:17.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁敢偷吃 我就宰了他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族的钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:24.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的双腿与右手上都有四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.86,0:02:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用速度把犬夜叉耍得团团转的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.43,0:02:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族正与极乐鸟一族战斗着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.87,0:02:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那似乎是为了夺取极乐鸟手上的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:40.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正因为我能看见四魂碎片所以被劫持了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.28,0:02:44.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这样下去 我和七宝都有可能会被吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.15,0:02:48.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有七宝也好 我希望他能逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦…七宝？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:02:59.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.69,0:03:01.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 叫你站起来听到没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:08.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 钢牙 你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.07,0:03:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把这女人带出去放一下风
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.91,0:03:13.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里都是野兽的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.11,0:03:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真厉害 演技太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.91,0:03:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 银太 白角
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们去保护钢牙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银太他们早就出去巡逻了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟钢牙一起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么？那刚才那个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个…竟敢骗本大爷！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:46.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是死路啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你能变成泡泡飞起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:12.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是不知道能不能载得动戈薇啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会让你们跑掉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 去把犬夜叉他们叫来 快！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的丫头 看我不吃掉你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.49,0:04:39.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 不是跟你们说不准偷吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:46.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个小家伙已经跑得那么远了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们去追他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 你就饶了我们好不好？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想被杀掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:03.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦…你是为了让同伴逃走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:10.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就当我的女人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢…钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.03,0:05:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人用完以后不是要吃掉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且那女人不是人类嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人能看见四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不只有极乐鸟有碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能收集到这附近所有的碎片哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能得到所有的碎片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:32.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们可就天下无敌了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.71,0:05:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙比普通的妖怪女人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要有用得多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.49,0:05:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫做戈薇对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.99,0:05:44.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天开始你就是我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.56,0:05:45.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:50.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 不要碰我啦 笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.37,0:06:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙打了钢牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人要被杀了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:11.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然叫人家做你的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.12,0:06:12.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样太没礼貌了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:16.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经有男朋友了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:19.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会是那只臭狗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就是那只臭狗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.83,0:06:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对 是犬夜叉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我男朋友可是有着犬夜叉这个好听的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.34,0:06:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准你叫他臭狗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你跟他有一腿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在胡说什么啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:38.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉喜欢的明明是桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:42.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样正好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.85,0:06:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来就打算再见到那家伙非宰了他不可的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:51.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要那个叫犬夜叉的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:52.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个世上消失的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:54.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就没有问题了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 它们是妖狼族的同伙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:17.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 我也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:20.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 弥勒 你也来帮帮忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:23.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就让这些妖怪抓走好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么呢？法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这一带是这些妖怪的猎场的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:35.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该散落着许多狼的骨骸才对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.34,0:07:37.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这里却根本没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那它们果然与妖狼族联合了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:42.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的怀疑是很合理的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么一来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.41,0:07:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我被他们抓走的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就可以找到他们的巢穴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可以救出戈薇他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.75,0:07:51.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事都解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.59,0:07:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.92,0:07:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:02.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要被抓走的那个就算不是我是你也行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然骗我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.07,0:08:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的身体不是比我的更结实嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师 不是要追吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先保持一段距离观察一下再说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 我要跟你交换！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:24.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.55,0:08:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得快点找到犬夜叉才行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:31.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉也被抓走了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才离开了一下就…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.96,0:08:39.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪我不够灵光…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:42.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs25}笨蛋 笨蛋 笨蛋 我这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 七宝 你没事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:45.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看 犬夜叉被抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战术？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜那些妖怪会带我们到妖狼族的巢穴去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.38,0:08:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:57.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族跟极乐鸟是敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:08:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇现在是在妖狼族的巢穴里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.99,0:09:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里真是狼的骸骨之山啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们跟极乐鸟是敌人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.13,0:09:10.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 听到没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:12.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在最讨厌的不是妖狼族和这些怪鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我放开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.01,0:09:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:24.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在最想干掉的就是弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 跟我决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这样说哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们快去救戈薇小姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒你给我站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要把我丢在这里啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弟兄们 都准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座山就是极乐鸟的巢穴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:02.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.05,0:10:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这座山的某处藏着拥有四魂碎片的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:07.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要找出那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.05,0:10:08.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 四魂之玉碎片一定就在这山中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须得到那四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快点来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被它们发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.57,0:10:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杂碎就交给你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉到四魂碎片的气息了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:50.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一边战斗一边找太难了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:53.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.55,0:10:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:56.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见四魂碎片了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿嘿 妖狼族的小鬼 我们等你好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身体中有四魂碎片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.29,0:11:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们兄弟俩一直想要得到它
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到你居然自己送上门来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们的想法都是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.44,0:11:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 四魂碎片在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碎片就在他们的嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:54.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.81,0:11:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要四魂碎片的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.31,0:12:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让我们吃掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.05,0:12:12.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:14.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护好戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.35,0:12:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好…可是你想干什么？钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.32,0:12:20.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把这个刺进那家伙的嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用这个去夺取它们嘴里的四魂碎片？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:24.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一个人太勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.83,0:12:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能跟那傻大个交手的只有我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.86,0:12:29.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.53,0:12:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 大嫂 我们去安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大嫂？你在叫我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是你啰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是我们少主的女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 怎么连你们都乱说话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往你们那边去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大嫂 危险
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:51.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大嫂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点救他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:54.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会被抓回巢穴里吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大嫂…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.73,0:13:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要射中啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射中了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:17.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:20.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这女人怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:24.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.09,0:13:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:52.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.61,0:13:54.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 弥勒大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:55.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:13:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族跟极乐鸟正在进行决战
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之要先想办法解决掉极乐鸟才行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了 让我来收拾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想死的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都给我退下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.91,0:14:25.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好…好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:26.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么招术啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭狗 正麻烦的时候你却跑来捣乱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.15,0:14:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在没空陪你玩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:38.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就饶你一命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.06,0:14:39.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.19,0:14:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你抓走戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:44.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要在这里跟你算总账
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:46.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 臭狗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以饶你一命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过不准你碰我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“我的女人”？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她能看到四魂碎片的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在是太适合当我的女人了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:14:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你说什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:02.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇小姐 他这么说哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不是的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:07.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是那家伙自作多情罢了而已呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那家伙…竟敢胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:13.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇是我的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.13,0:15:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱上戈薇了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:21.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇跟我在一起才幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起跟弱小的臭狗在一起要好得多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了不让戈薇有丝毫留恋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早晚会把你也干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.48,0:15:30.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:33.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也就会毫无保留地爱上我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.55,0:15:38.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是霸道的家伙啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:40.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 应该是惹人羡慕的性格啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.39,0:15:44.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.99,0:15:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开口闭口都是戈薇戈薇戈薇的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.16,0:15:49.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别叫得这么亲密啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 不是跟你说现在很忙的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快回去快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.04,0:16:04.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.41,0:16:07.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙君 那个家伙在更上面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.42,0:16:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙…君？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:16.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要再上吗 已经快到顶了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的这一招
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.01,0:16:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼头你还送上自己的右手了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:16:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手臂上的碎片被抢走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:17.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次的目标是我双腿的碎片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你…你又想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:35.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴好好看着 瘦狼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.87,0:17:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你见识一下我有多强
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:41.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有两个四魂碎片了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大哥 力量…力量涌出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.31,0:17:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引出铁碎牙真正威力的轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:57.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.05,0:17:59.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把那只大怪鸟一击就干掉了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经掌握了风之伤呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然碍事的大怪鸟解决掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轮到我们两人一决高下了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然抱在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:44.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还说要决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是那种时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.07,0:18:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙受伤了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点小伤…算不了什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:53.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 你撑着点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.21,0:18:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么…为什么要袒护那小子…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:18:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这种货色
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.18,0:19:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只用左手也能把你干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.72,0:19:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还敢神气啊 接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:13.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在赶快逃吧 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:17.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们闪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.47,0:19:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.04,0:19:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:26.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么故意放他们走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为…他受了这么重的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:32.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们本性也还不坏…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:34.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还说他不坏？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.89,0:19:36.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你不是被劫持还差点丧命吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话…话虽如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他也还是保护了我的…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:46.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然动情了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉 被人家这么华丽地告白了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫戈薇怎么恨他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:55.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可笑了 我不管了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:03.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是极乐鸟身上的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:06.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和钢牙被极乐鸟抢走的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:08.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子还会回来抢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.59,0:20:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉下次再遇到钢牙的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:15.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是又非得拚个你死我活呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.23,0:20:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.79,0:20:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去安慰一下犬夜叉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他先前真的很担心你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.94,0:20:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这么下去他还真有点可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:36.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 让你替我担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你及时赶来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实别来救你比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看那家伙的花言巧语捧得心花怒放
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花言巧语
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:49.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说钢牙喜欢我的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:51.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很在意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:53.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在意什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:55.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本没放在心上！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.77,0:20:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明就很在意嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:21:00.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先说清楚 我对钢牙一点意思都没有哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:04.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁…谁也没问你那个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.04,0:21:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.84,0:21:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上你跟他发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:19.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.76,0:21:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在怀疑我什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.29,0:21:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你刚才一直那样看我的啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.36,0:21:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你要冲着我发脾气啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.37,0:21:31.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪你有那种奇怪的误会啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烦死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不想看到你这张脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你去哪好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:38.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.18,0:21:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.31,0:21:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母借我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.08,0:21:45.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会是去找钢牙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:50.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回自己家！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.02,0:21:52.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.59,0:21:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.09,0:21:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇生气的时侯好可怕啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.20,0:22:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才…才不可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.70,0:22:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不怕呢！可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.52,0:23:50.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从开始往返与战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.12,0:23:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还是我头一次这么生气
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.46,0:23:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉那家伙 我绝对不会原谅他的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.63,0:23:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是感觉有点怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像忘了什么重要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.20,0:24:05.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的…我国中三年的青春
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.04,0:24:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该在现代度过的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.30,0:24:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.71,0:24:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远隔万里而相通的二人之心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.14,0:24:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.45,0:24:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉宝典
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.98,0:25:22.17,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖狼族的天敌{\pos(262,289)}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.98,0:25:22.17,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有着鸟的身体与人类的上半身{\pos(323,414)}
